x, or eighteen, just three. I've found it to be true in every business I've ever run. Those three ways are: 1) Get more customers. Most ecommerce businesses do a good job focusing on this. It’s the only thing they seem to cate about. 2) Inctease the size of your orders. Get your customers to spend more money when they purchase. Some stores do this well, but it’s often overlooked or only halfheartedly attempted. 3) Increase the order frequency. Get your customers to buy more often, turning a one-time buyer into a twotime buyer and so on. The more repeat purchases you have, the more money you make. 31\",\"page_118\":\"“This book is the equivalent of a PhD-level ecommerce education. Pure actionable information without any of the usual fluff.” - Matthew Stafford, CMO Canvus.com- EVOLVED The Essential Playbook to BUILD, GROW & SCALE ~ A Successful Ecommerce Business TANNER LARSSON Founder & CEO www.BuildGrowScale.com\",\"page_124\":\"“This book is the equivalent of a PhD-level ecommerce education. Pure actionable information without any of the usual fluff.” - Matthew Stafford, CMO Canvus.com- EVOLVED The Essential Playbook to BUILD, GROW & SCALE ~ A Successful Ecommerce Business TANNER LARSSON Founder & CEO www.BuildGrowScale.com\",\"page_74\":\"“This book is the equivalent of a PhD-level ecommerce education. Pure actionable information without any of the usual fluff.” - Matthew Stafford, CMO Canvus.com- EVOLVED The Essential Playbook to BUILD, GROW & SCALE ~ A Successful Ecommerce Business TANNER LARSSON Founder & CEO www.BuildGrowScale.com\",\"page_142\":\"“This book is the equivalent of a PhD-level ecommerce education. Pure actionable information without any of the usual fluff.” - Matthew Stafford, CMO Canvus.com- EVOLVED The Essential Playbook to BUILD, GROW & SCALE ~ A Successful Ecommerce Business TANNER LARSSON Founder & CEO www.BuildGrowScale.com\",\"page_86\":\"“This book is the equivalent of a PhD-level ecommerce education. Pure actionable information without a